        "Fast Ship S.S. Aqua is en route to\n",
        "Vermilion City.\r",
        "We will make an announcement when\n",
        "we arrive."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0259_P01R0301_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Fast Ship S.S. Aqua\n",
        "is en route to Olivine City.\r",
        "We will make an announcement when\n",
        "we arrive."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0259_P01R0301_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Fast Ship S.S. Aqua\n",
        "has arrived in Vermilion City.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0259_P01R0301_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Fast Ship S.S. Aqua\n",
        "has arrived in Vermilion City."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0259_P01R0301_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Huh?\n",
        "It’s already arrived in Vermilion City.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0259_P01R0301_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Fast Ship S.S. Aqua\n",
        "has arrived in Olivine City.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0259_P01R0301_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Fast Ship S.S. Aqua\n",
        "has arrived in Olivine City."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0259_P01R0301_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Whoa! Excuse me. I was in a hurry!\r",
        "My granddaughter is missing!\r",
        "She’s just a wee girl. If you see\n",
        "her, please let me know!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0259_P01R0301_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Here’s your cabin.\r",
        "If your Pokémon are hurt, take a\n",
        "nap in the bed.\f",
        "That will heal them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0259_P01R0301_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Here’s your cabin.\r",
        "You can heal your Pokémon\n",
        "by taking a nap in the bed.\r",
        "The ship will arrive while\n",
        "you’re sleeping."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0259_P01R0301_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Most passengers are Trainers.\r",
        "They’re all itching to battle in\n",
        "their cabins."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0259_P01R0301_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome to... Cinnabar Island...\n",
        "I suggest you... head north..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0259_P01R0301_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "(There’s an odd feeling... as if a\n",
        "legendary force wanted you here.)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0259_P01R0301_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "You there! Do you know Phione?\r",
        "If you can show me a Phione,\n",
        "I’ll give you a reward!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0259_P01R0301_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "By jove, it’s a real Phione!\r",
        "But that’s not enough, you see!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0259_P01R0301_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "If you can show me a Manaphy,\n",
        "then I’ll really give you a reward!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0259_P01R0301_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "By jove, it’s a real Manaphy!\r",
        "Here, take this!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0259_P01R0301_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you, young sir!\n",
        "Fare thee well!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0259_P01R0301_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you, young lass!\n",
        "Fare thee well!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
